# claude-mem auto-generates a per-directory CLAUDE.md scratch file (Recent
# Activity context) as a side effect of coding sessions; it's not part of
# this project's source. The repo root's own CLAUDE.md (a symlink to
# AGENTS.md, tracked deliberately) is exempted.
**/CLAUDE.md
!/CLAUDE.md
